<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM NOV NET RISES TO PLN 4.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM NOV NET RISES TO PLN 4.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.39 vs   2.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.97 vs  10.46</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.30 vs   4.18</p>
<p> Sales		   76.22 vs  57.72</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    36.38 vs  48.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit     168.87 vs 191.76</p>
<p> Operating profit    37.16 vs  46.99</p>
<p> Sales		  803.14 vs 538.60</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial and trading</p>
<p>conglomerate is Elektrim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
